{
  "id": "ISA.57",
  "number": "57",
  "bookId": "ISA",
  "reference": "Isaya 57",
  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "57",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 57"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "57",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omugorogoki afa, kyonkai taliho abyetaho. Abagonza Ruhanga bafa, kyonkai taliho ashobokerwa kigambo ekyo. Omugorogoki k'afa, aba arugire omu naku, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abona emilembe. Abakora kurungi bahumurage. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywe baana b'omukazi omurogi, inywe baana b'omumalaya ensiyani, mwije hanu aha! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ohai ogwo owo mulikuzanisa? N'ohai ogwo owo mulikukomorolera akanwa mukajuma? Inywe ngobya, inywe bafakare! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obunyama butuli kubi; nimusiyanira omu mialoni n'omu bigabiro; abaana banyu nimubatamba ebitambo omu mpanga, omu mpako z'amabare! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimwihyayo amabare g'entelere, nimugeta baruhanga nimugafukamira. Nimugahongera edivai orwo mulikugishesha ahansi, nimugahongera n'emyaka. Inywe nimulenga muti byona ebi nimbishemelerwa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimugya aha mabanga eiguru mtuli abantu batalikutura, niho mulikutambira ebitambo n'okusiyanirayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyuma y'emilyango n'aha mizilingiti mutaireho ebihuuku by'obujanga. Mumpoiremu; mwajura emyendo, mwahonga bagenda banyu, mwabyama nabo aha bitanda byanyu ebihango, mwaba niho mumalira aganyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimwesiga amarasi, n'amajuta kugya kufukamira Moleki. Buli hantu nangu na Sheoli mwatumireyo entumwa nimuhiga ruhanga ow'okufukamira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwahigire baruhanga abandi mwalemesiibwe, kyonkai timulikunanukwa. Nimutekeleza ngu ebihuuku byanyu by'obujanga nibibaha amani, nikyo mwikalira mugumire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni baruhangaki aba abo mulikutina, mukagoba aha kumbeiya mukanyebwa, mukaba mutakintekelezayo? Mulekeire kunkunira aha rw'okuba nyesilize orurai? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywe nimulenga muti ebyo mulikukora birungi, kyonkai ninyija kubyarura nyije mbone nka baruhanga banyu barabajuna! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutake ndebe nk'ebihuuku byanyu ebyo birabarokora! Manya nibija kutwarwa omuyaga, n'orwoya rwonkai tirubisige mtuli bili. Kyonkai abahungira ahali inye tulilya ensi batega kunfukamira omuli Rwensinga yange.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama nagamba ati, “Mutinde embarabara, mutinde embarabara, mugishemeze. Mwihyemu ensibu, eihanga lyange libone oburabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inye ndi Ruhanga omukuru mara Omutakatifu, mba nyakumelera. Ntuura omu mabanga eiguru aheheleire, kyonkai nshuba ntura n'abantu abetohya bakechuza amafu gabo, nkabaha okunyesiga n'okunshubira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'inye nahaire eihanga lyange oburora, kandi tinyikare mbakwete mushango anga kubanigalira eirai lyona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaba mbatamirwe nimbatura amafu gabo n'omururu, nikyo nabahweleiremu mara nkababonabonyia. Kyonkai bakaguma bagumangaine bayekolera agabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo bakora mbibona kyonkai ndabakiza. Ndabahabura mbajune, n'atulikuchura mbamaramare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bona nimbagondeza emilembe: Atuli haihi n'atuli harai! Eihanga lyange ndalikiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai abantu ababi bashusha enyanja eikara nechundaiguka, amayengo gayo gaikara nigatera, nigakukumba ekomboto n'ewangaija. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikwo n'abafakare bataligira milembe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
